---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="Working principles — Sharad Adhikari" description="Principles behind the work on sharad.fr.">
  <article>
    <p class="back"><a href="/">← home</a></p>
    <header>
      <h1>Working principles</h1>
      <p class="lede">A few rules that keep the work grounded.</p>
    </header>

    <h2>Use real inputs</h2>
    <p>Prototype quickly, but do not confuse a fictional demo with a functioning product.</p>

    <h2>Explain uncertainty</h2>
    <p>If coverage is incomplete or a comparison has limits, make that part of the interface.</p>

    <h2>Keep the next step obvious</h2>
    <p>Good design is not decoration around a workflow. It is the workflow becoming easier to understand.</p>

  </article>
  <Footer />
</Base>
